          "document_id": "med-doc-789ce78a7120946a49ec",
          "domain": "medical",
          "text": "Learn how to cope with stress. Take Care of Your Eyes High blood glucose and high blood pressure from diabetes can hurt your eyes. It can even cause blindness, or other painful eye problems. Here are ways to prevent diabetes eye problems. - Keep your blood glucose and blood pressure as close to normal as you can. - Have an eye care professional examine your eyes once a year. Have this exam even if your vision is okay. Keep your blood glucose and blood pressure as close to normal as you can. Have an eye care professional examine your eyes once a year. Have this exam even if your vision is okay. Learn more about eye disease and diabetes. Protect",
          "score": 0.014120760959470638,
          "source_url": "https://github.com/abachaa/MedQuAD/tree/577bd37b96c02d1833b2c9eed2de9f96964e96cb",
          "locator": "med-doc-789ce78a7120946a49ec/med-chunk-1fd3518bfe75fc88189f",
          "text_sha256": "86f6e64de0ed751ac3e8776bf43a543a5a5c69292f12fbd535f8bb2a2d600b76",
          "source_sha256": "42f025f955852567436dc7cd7efde701ca014429f47dacae7d7c0ba23ab51f29",
          "graph_path": [
            "kg-node-fcb21efed59ffe4ef1ceac5c",
